  "name": "Passive Features",
  "description": "§e§lStats:§r\n-30% Max Health\n+20% Ground & Air Speed\n-20% Height\n \n§e§lFeatures:§r\n- You are an Arthropod and can climb vertical surfaces.\n- Cobwebs do not slow you. Your melee attacks briefly trap targets in cobwebs and inflict Poison for 3 seconds.\n- You can sense creatures trapped in cobwebs or affected by §c§l[Webbed]§r. Undetectable creatures are excluded.\n- Outside sunlight, you deal 20% more damage to creatures trapped in cobwebs or affected by §c§l[Webbed]§r.\n- You can craft cobwebs.\n- Fire does not extinguish on its own.\n- You see better in darkness than most creatures.",
